# Copy to .env.local for local development. Do NOT commit .env.local.

# Development-only demo-data switch (see src/config/demoMode.js).
# true   -> force demo mode: local fixtures only, mutations simulated locally.
# empty  -> force demo mode with ZERO fixtures (for checking truthful empty states).
# unset  -> normal: real API data; screens that support it fall back to demo fixtures
#           only when the real list is empty (never on an API error).
# Never enable this in a production build.
VITE_DEMO_DATA=
